    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Act as a marketing copywriter for an automation agency.\n\nWrite a Facebook post based strictly on the topic below, designed for daily posting to engage followers and promote services.\n\nTOPIC:\n{{ $json.Content }}\n\nCONTENT STRUCTURE:\n\nFirst line: 1 short, punchy hook (max 8 words)\n\nMain body: 2–4 paragraphs, 2–3 sentences each. Can include additional tips, insights, or examples. Some paragraphs may be bullet points or numbered lists if it feels natural.\n\nMake it varied so not every post has the same structure.\n\nInclude value, practical benefits, or interesting details in every sentence.\n\nOne line break should separate paragraphs\n\nSTYLE & TONE:\n\nDirect, confident, practical, and engaging\n\nSounds like a real agency sharing insights\n\nNo hype, no buzzwords, no corporate jargon\n\nFocused on benefits, results, and real-world impact\n\nFORMAT RULES (STRICT):\n\nDo NOT use quotation marks\n\nDo NOT add extra spacing or blank lines\n\nUse EXACTLY one line break between paragraphs\n\nOutput ONLY the final post text\n\nLENGTH RULES:\n\nMaximum 80 words total\n\nShort sentences preferred\n\nEvery sentence must add value\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThe output must be clean, properly formatted, and ready to post directly to Facebook without any editing\n\nAdd 4–5 relevant hashtags at the end of the post related to automation, digital marketing, and business growth",
        "options": {}
      },
